ross phases, ensuring the correct number of shields are always correct when the fight moves to the second arena.\n\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Watcher enemies are more stable in the Steamvault sector, with cleaner spawning behaviour and better resilience to misconfigured spawn points.\n\ud83d\udef8 Fixed a multiplayer issue where the end-of-mission dropship could leave the host behind on a successful run, dropping them at the hub spawn with no landing sequence.\n\ud83e\ude91 Fixed a follow-on hub soft-lock where sitting in any chair after the dropship bug left you unable to stand back up or change seats.\n\ud83d\udeaa Fixed players becoming permanently stuck in the hub with the dropship back door refusing to open even though the mission was available; affected saves will now self-heal on load.\n\ud83c\udfac Fixed a black-screen hang when quitting to the Start Menu, with a safety timeout so a stalled save can no longer strand you on a black screen.\n\ud83c\udfc1 Fixed the End Game epic occasionally remaining locked after beating Apex, which kept hub elements gated; affected saves now repair themselves on load and the New Game+ button shows correctly.\n\ud83d\udeaa Fixed enemy gates appearing closed for players who joined a session late, even when the gate had already been opened by the host.\n", "created_date": 1778456759, "id": "35565204303094891", "version": "1.13.3", "version_code": 565, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "35565199596428695"}, "asset_files": {"count": 10}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8332853930089963", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35565204303094891"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1778419479, "id": "35555608667387788", "version": "1.13.2", "version_code": 564, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "35555599474055374"}, "asset_files": {"count": 10}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8332853930089963", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35565204303094891"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3336161029990352"}]}, "change_log": "Titan Isles v1.12.3 Release Notes\n\n\u2728 What's New\n\n\ud83d\uded2 Daily Shop is now live with rotating items and limited-time on-sale offers.\n\u2764\ufe0f Heart Tokens are here. Revive yourself or donate to the team pool.\n\ud83d\udcab Blink's can now fire dual discs that link together causing a cutting damage line.\n\n\u2699\ufe0f Improvements\n\n\u2696\ufe0f Major suit balancing pass: Blink moves faster, dashes more often, and link damage hits harder. Hunter and overall max speeds retuned.\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Goliath Shield reflections now correctly bounce Hunter arrows and Blink discs.\n\ud83e\udd98 Wall Jump multiplier raised for more dynamic platforming.\n\u270b Improved interactables: Items no longer get stuck in your hand and now respawn when dropped into water, off the map, or after long falls.\n\ud83c\udfc6 Full prestige bonuses now apply in the hub regardless of difficulty.\n\ud83c\udfaf Refined laser power, training targets, and Energy Disc colliders.\n\ud83c\udfae Smoother network sync keeps weapon movement fluid even under poor connections.\n\u2728 Refreshed prestige icons.\n\ud83e\udea6 Visual improvements to the Graveyard area.\n\ud83c\udf81 Brand new mug designs.\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n\ud83c\udf6f A fix for player feet getting caught under ledges and sinking into honeycomb edges in Wasp Hunt..\n\ud83d\udc7b Fixed ghost avatars left behind after a player force-quit.\n\ud83d\udd04 Fixed scene transitions getting stuck when joining a host or cancelling a connection.\n\u23f3 Fixed multi-minute load screens after a teammate crashed mid-mission.\n\ud83d\udc65 Fixed double debrief entries and slow dropship loads after a player rejoined.\n\ud83c\udd99 Fixed New Game+ level sticking to the host's value after leaving multiplayer.\n\ud83c\udff9 Fixed bows getting stuck when grip input latched in the dead zone.\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Fixed force field touch state sticking after a scene unload.\n\ud83c\udfaf Fixed regular ricochets dealing no damage.\n\ud83d\udce6 Fixed multiple misplaced/intersecting breakable boxes.\n\ud83c\udfae Fixed UI buttons going dead after the first click when a finger stayed in the hover zone, and added a cross-panel\ncooldown to prevent misclicks.\n\u270b Fixed the Agree splash button getting stuck when a hand was already inside the collider.\n\ud83e\udd1d Fixed cases where one hand could end up holding two items or transfer onto an already-holding hand.\n\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f Fixed prestige icon showing 5 dots for the 6th tier.\n\ud83d\udcac Voice chat now retries transient login and channel-join errors instead of failing outright.\n\ud83e\uddca Locomotion now freezes while the headset is unfocused, preventing drift while in system menus.\n\ud83c\udf9a\ufe0f Fixed some player options that previously failed to save now persist correctly between sessions.\n\ud83c\udfe0 Hosted lobbies stay hidden until the host is ready, and lock once the host leaves the start menu, preventing failed\njoins.", "created_date": 1778101551, "id": "35470446735903982", "version": "1.12.3", "version_code": 562, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "35470441129237876"}, "asset_files": {"count": 10}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8332853930089963", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35565204303094891"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1778089329, "id": "35467134769568512", "version": "1.12.2", "version_code": 561, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "35467126639569325"}, "asset_files": {"count": 10}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}